msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Savjet: otvorite Glimpse odmah gestom.\n"
"\n"
"Postavite je u Postavke → Dodiri i geste → Upravitelj gesti → odaberite gestu → Čitač → 'Otvori Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Ovaj savjet prikazuje se samo jednom.)"

